{
  "id": "S12ErrorHandler001",
  "name": "S12 · 05 Error workflow: avisar y registrar",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Error workflow\nSe asigna en *Settings → Error workflow* de cada workflow que quieras vigilar. Se ejecuta cuando ese workflow **falla** (no cuando falla el sub-workflow, salvo que el error suba).\n\nAquí: arma un aviso y lo guarda en la bitácora simulada. En producción: chat o correo de guardia.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "6370e40d-a572-55c4-a5dd-08790fad1df0",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "e32e94cb-bc33-5989-b0a9-1d9cbd5212b4",
      "name": "Error Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const e = $json;\nconst aviso = {\n  tipo: 'error',\n  canal: 'guardia-simulada',\n  workflow: e.workflow?.name,\n  ejecucion: e.execution?.id,\n  nodo: e.execution?.lastNodeExecuted,\n  mensaje: String(e.execution?.error?.message ?? 'sin mensaje').slice(0, 300),\n  url_ejecucion: e.execution?.url,\n  ts: new Date().toISOString(),\n};\nreturn [{ json: aviso }];"
      },
      "id": "d0328e43-7a74-5e81-baa3-73dae42faa8e",
      "name": "Armar aviso",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:5678/webhook/sim-registro",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 5000
        }
      },
      "id": "ad6727a5-30a9-52cf-ac1c-380c62a01229",
      "name": "Registrar el error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Error Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Armar aviso",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Armar aviso": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Registrar el error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "active": false,
  "versionId": "5e8e0732-eac1-55ee-9bc8-8aa6dcd51370",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
